This directory contains the OS-independent "shared code" of the Intel irdma
driver, imported from Linux v6.18-rc2-10-g552c50713f27, commit
552c50713f273b494ac6c77052032a49bc9255e2 (drivers/infiniband/hw/irdma).

Every file carries "SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 OR Linux-OpenIB" (some
spell it "or") and is used here under the Linux-OpenIB license; see
THIRDPARTYLICENSE.  A file whose license line changes upstream must not be
imported again without a new review.

Only the code the E810 (GEN2) control plane and later the kernel verbs need
is imported.  The Linux OS layer (main.c, hw.c, utils.c, verbs.c, cm.c,
icrdma_if.c, osdep.h), the GEN1 and GEN3 hardware files (i40iw_*, ig3rdma_*),
the virtual channel (virtchnl.c) and the trace files are not.  Linux osdep.h
is to be replaced by an osdep.h written for illumos.  GEN1 and GEN3 paths stay
in the files and are not to be reached: the driver will run only IRDMA_GEN_2.

